B.bom=s(["Bloke sal sa a? Apar\xe8y ki konekte yo ap p\xe8di aks\xe8 l\xe8 yo kontakte s\xe8v\xe8 a. Apar\xe8y offline yo rete limite pa otorizasyon offline yo.","Bloquer cette salle ? Les appareils connect\xe9s perdront l\u2019acc\xe8s au prochain contact serveur. Les appareils hors ligne restent limit\xe9s par leur autorisation locale.","Block this gym? Connected devices lose access at the next server contact. Offline devices remain limited by their local authorization lease."],t.s)
B.bdJ=s(["P\xe8m\xe8t sal sa a konekte epi senkronize ank\xf2?","Autoriser cette salle \xe0 se connecter et \xe0 synchroniser \xe0 nouveau ?","Allow this gym to connect and synchronize again?"],t.s)
B.bro=s(["Achivaj la bloke sal la epi retire li nan lis aktif la. Istorik la kons\xe8ve. Antre k\xf2d sal la pou konfime.","L\u2019archivage bloque la salle et la retire de la liste active. L\u2019historique est conserv\xe9. Saisissez son code pour confirmer.","Archiving blocks the gym and removes it from the active list. History is retained. Enter its code to confirm."],t.s)
B.bd3=s(["K\xf2d sal la pou konfime","Code de la salle pour confirmer","Gym code to confirm"],t.s)
B.byE=s(["Reyinisyalize modpas","R\xe9initialiser le mot de passe","Reset password"],t.s)
B.bvT=s(["Voye yon im\xe8l reyinisyalizasyon bay pwopriyet\xe8 sal sa a?","Envoyer un email de r\xe9initialisation au propri\xe9taire de cette salle ?","Send a password reset email to this gym\u2019s owner?"],t.s)
B.bil=s(["Demann im\xe8l reyinisyalizasyon an aksepte.","La demande d\u2019email de r\xe9initialisation est accept\xe9e.","The password reset email request was accepted."],t.s)
B.bv5=s(["Lyen retou pou reyinisyalizasyon an poko konfigire sou s\xe8v\xe8 a.","L\u2019URL de retour de r\xe9initialisation n\u2019est pas configur\xe9e sur le serveur.","The password-reset redirect URL is not configured on the server."],t.s)
B.bj1=s(["Pa gen pwopriyet\xe8 aktif pou sal sa a.","Aucun propri\xe9taire actif pour cette salle.","This gym has no active owner."],t.s)
B.bhL=s(["Im\xe8l sa a deja gen yon kont. Chwazi yon l\xf2t im\xe8l; aplikasyon an pa transfere kont ant sal yo.","Cet email poss\xe8de d\xe9j\xe0 un compte. Choisissez un autre email ; l\u2019application ne transf\xe8re pas les comptes entre salles.","This email already has an account. Choose another email; accounts are not transferred between gyms."],t.s)
