B.bcf=s(["Kreyasyon an pa konfime. Kenbe menm demann lan epi eseye ank\xf2.","La cr\xe9ation n\u2019est pas confirm\xe9e. Conservez la m\xeame demande et r\xe9essayez.","Creation is not confirmed. Keep the same request and retry."],t.s)
B.b3k=s(["Tw\xf2p demann. Tann yon ti moman epi eseye ank\xf2.","Trop de demandes. Patientez puis r\xe9essayez.","Too many requests. Wait before trying again."],t.s)
